+2.  Loop `octaves`.
+3.  Get `n = noisedQ(p * frequency)` [S25].
+4.  Accumulate `deriv += n.yz` [S25].
+5.  Add `amplitude * n.x / (1.0 + dot(deriv, deriv))` to `value` [S25].
+6.  Update `frequency *= 2.0`, `amplitude *= 0.5`, `p = rot * p` [S25].
 
